  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the cod fillets under cold water and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a large pot, combine the water, carrots, celery, onion, and garlic, and bring to a boil over high heat.",
    "Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 10 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the cod fillets to the pot and cook for 5 minutes, or until they are cooked through and flake easily with a fork.",
    "Stir in the chopped dill, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Squeeze the lemon juice over the stew and serve hot.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the stew in bowls and garnish with additional chopped dill, if desired."
  ],
